    narr:narration """The requirement for a [signed release manifest](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all Meridian deployments has been formally ratified as a [mandatory gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3). This policy, [owned by Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), is explicitly [scoped to both staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) environments. The directive is framed as a corrective measure, [directly responding to past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) where unsigned artifacts reached staging, establishing a shift from descriptive process to a hard, legitimate enforcement mechanism.""" ;
